    "undirected graph edge between nodes 2 and 3",
    "undirected graph edge between nodes 3 and 4",
    "undirected graph edge between nodes 3 and 6",
    "undirected graph edge between nodes 4 and 5",
    "undirected graph edge between nodes 5 and 6",
    "edge identity labels or implied endpoint-pair labels for edges (1,3), (1,4), (2,3), (3,4), (3,6), (4,5), (5,6)",
    "six vertical node-feature stacks near the graph nodes, each drawn as a column of small square cells in brown and peach tones",
    "seven vertical edge-feature stacks near graph edges, each drawn as a column of small square cells in teal tones",
    "panel label 'b)' for the adjacency matrix",
    "title text 'Adjacency matrix, A, N × N'",
    "6 by 6 adjacency matrix grid with column labels 1 through 6 and row labels 1 through 6",
